                                "example_id": "8f514fee-513d-403f-ac63-bb7594b5214f",
                                "sense_id": "f3ff92eb-63fa-3161-bc19-c4a921a33ca9",
                                "text": "What made Dodrill's Tournedo Chestertown so appealing was the harmonious union of infrequently combined ingredients. The slightly sweet cornbread provided the perfect foil for the buttery taste of the tournedo and crab beurre blanc, while ..."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "56002f80-b3aa-46f2-ae8d-d51e7161e0e5",
                                "sense_id": "f3ff92eb-63fa-3161-bc19-c4a921a33ca9",
                                "text": "If you cooked a tournedo (which is a slice of beef filet), for example, sauced it with a brown sauce of reduced white wine and veal demi-glace, and garnished it with an artichoke bottom filled with little nuggets of potato […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "87727a32-dcee-40bd-8512-8610e1d91b14",
                                "sense_id": "f3ff92eb-63fa-3161-bc19-c4a921a33ca9",
                                "text": "Place an untied tournedo on each crouton. Neatly spread the garnish all around them. Coat the tournedos and place a piece of truffle on top. Moderately sprinkle some chopped parsley on the Cocotte potatoes."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
